purpose: How are documents reviewed one at a time, and what does the review check guarantee?

Records that documents get an individual editorial review and that the native check and push gate block missing receipts and post-review body changes, without proving sentence quality or report approval.
Translated from Korean to English; frontmatter, command names (`engsys review record/check`) and the `review-document` skill name are unchanged.
Headings: 문제 -> Problem, 결정 -> Decision, 대안과 비용 -> "Alternatives and Costs" (kept as costs, not renamed to Consequences, because the section is about costs; "Cost" satisfies the contract pattern), 보장 범위 -> Scope of the Guarantee.
상급자 rendered as "managers"; 자기 검토 as self-review.
The guarantee limits (no proof of truthfulness, independence or quality) are preserved verbatim in meaning. No Korean literals retained.

